<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>2.&#160;&#160;Elimination of Series 1, Series 2, and Series 3 Preferred
Shares</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Stockholders approved the amendment of the Certificate
