<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>5.&#160;&#160;Amendment of Certificate of Incorporation to Update,
Clarify and Remove Outdated Provisions</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Stockholders approved the amendment of the Certificate
of Incorporation to update, clarify and remove outdated provisions, in accordance with the voting results below.</p>

